# Low Water, Act 2: interrogations (SYSTEMS-FULL section 20). Director, 2026-10-17.

@fact quay2.sallis_told

# ================================================================ Rook, at the telegraph counter
@interrogation x2.rook
name: Rook, about the 18:30 draft
who: rook
place: telegraph
nerve: 6
heat: 0
cool: 1
hold: 25
bolt: 4 -> x2.rook.bolts
break: x2.rook.tells
walk: x2.rook.walk
press: fist "Lean both hands on her counter." -> x2.rook.lean {nerve: -1, heat: +3}
press: tongue "Say she's the only one in Gullet who still reads the line." -> x2.rook.line {nerve: -2, heat: -1, skill: condolence, dc: 5}
press: hands "Take the half past six off the spike and lay it face up." -> x2.rook.spike ? count(i.draft) > 0 | has(ropewalk.draft_taken) {nerve: -4}
press: shadow "Tell her what she reads aloud to herself at night, with the shutter down." -> x2.rook.night ? has(typist.heard) | has(ropewalk.coe_watch) {nerve: -3}
press: any "Wait while the sounder ticks." -> x2.rook.tick {nerve: -1, again}
lie: l.recall "I don't recall it. I don't recall any of it." {catch: ropewalk.envelope_read, nerve: -4, node: x2.rook.caught, after: 5}
tell: 3 "She puts her hand flat on the oilcloth book, as if it might get up."

@node x2.rook.start
place: telegraph
speaker: ROOK
cost: 1
line: Ask what you like. The line's dead. I've time.
do: interrogate(x2.rook)
return:

@node x2.rook.lean
speaker: ROOK
line: The counter's older than you. It's been leaned on by better.
return:

@node x2.rook.line
speaker: ROOK
line: Somebody has to. If nobody reads it, it might as well not come.
return:

@node x2.rook.spike
speaker: ROOK
nar: She looks at the draft the way a woman looks at her own handwriting in a stranger's pocket.
return:

@node x2.rook.night
speaker: ROOK
line: A woman can read aloud in her own office.
return:

@node x2.rook.tick
nar: The sounder ticks once, by itself, and stops.
return:

@node x2.rook.caught
speaker: ROOK
line: I recall the envelope. Everyone recalls an envelope.
return:

@node x2.rook.tells
place: telegraph
speaker: ROOK
cost: 4
do: set(telegram.draft); set(ropewalk.yellow_time)
line: The 9.40 was on it when he handed it over. In yellow. Not his ink; he writes in pencil.
line: He struck it out at my counter, hard enough to cut the paper, and wrote SEE BELOW. There was nothing below.
go: ropewalk.rook.menu

@node x2.rook.bolts
place: telegraph
speaker: ROOK
cost: 2
line: I'm going upstairs. The office is shut. It's been shut since you came in.
go: ropewalk.hub

@node x2.rook.walk
speaker: ROOK
line: I don't recall you came in.
go: ropewalk.hub

# ================================================================ Sallis, at the mole steps, after the muster
@interrogation x2.sallis
name: Sallis, about who pays
who: sallis
place: mole_steps
nerve: 6
heat: 1
cool: 1
bolt: 9 -> x2.sallis.walk
swing: 6 -> quay2.wardens
break: x2.sallis.tells
walk: x2.sallis.walk
press: fist "Take the crowbar out of his hand." -> x2.sallis.bar {nerve: -2, heat: +3, skill: grip, dc: 6}
press: tongue "Say he has never stolen a thing in his life." -> x2.sallis.never {nerve: -3, heat: -1, skill: condolence, dc: 6}
press: hands "Lay the claim form on the step and point to where it says persons." -> x2.sallis.form {nerve: -2}
press: shadow "Repeat what he read to the men, word for word." -> x2.sallis.words ? has(quay2.muster_seen) {nerve: -3}
lie: l.orders "Board's orders, Shelf. I don't make them." {catch: quay2.muster_seen, nerve: -4, node: x2.sallis.caught, after: 5}
tell: 3 "He shifts the crowbar to his other hand, and then back."

@node x2.sallis.start
place: mole_steps
speaker: SALLIS
cost: 1
line: Quick, Shelf. The ebb doesn't wait for the insurer.
do: interrogate(x2.sallis)
return:

@node x2.sallis.bar
speaker: SALLIS
line: That's Board iron. You'll want a docket for that.
return:

@node x2.sallis.never
speaker: SALLIS
line: Never. Not a nail. Ask anybody on this quay.
return:

@node x2.sallis.form
speaker: SALLIS
line: Persons. It's a word, Shelf. Words don't row out to the Spit.
return:

@node x2.sallis.words
speaker: SALLIS
nar: Behind him the men have stopped loading, to listen to their own reason said back to them.
return:

@node x2.sallis.caught
speaker: SALLIS
line: Not orders, then. The paper. It's the same thing.
return:

@node x2.sallis.tells
place: mole_steps
speaker: SALLIS
cost: 4
do: set(quay2.sallis_told)
line: Nobody ordered it. Keel said at the office the Board pays carriage on salvage, by the ton, and the Shelf pays the Board.
line: The rest I read in the Courier, same as everyone. I put two and two together. It came to a boat.
go: quay2.boats

@node x2.sallis.walk
speaker: SALLIS
line: Mind the step. It's slippy for clerks.
go: quay2.boats
